+### 4.3 list_conversations
+
+Request to list the authenticated user's conversations. Available only when `transport.history` is enabled in the server configuration.
+
+```json
+{
+  "type": "list_conversations",
+  "limit": 20,
+  "before": {"updatedAt": "2026-11-07T12:00:00.000Z", "sessionId": "s-prev"}
+}
+```
+
+| Field    | Type   | Required | Description                                                       |
+| -------- | ------ | -------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |
+| `type`   | string | Yes      | `"list_conversations"`                                            |
+| `limit`  | number | No       | Maximum results, integer 1–200                                    |
+| `before` | object | No       | Cursor: `{updatedAt: string, sessionId: string}`, newest excluded |
+
+- `list_conversations` is accepted by `validateMessage` whether or not `transport.history` is enabled; the handler refuses it when the feature is off. `limit`, when present, must be an integer 1–200; `before`, when present, must be a cursor object whose `updatedAt` a `Date.parse` accepts; either violation answers `INVALID_MESSAGE` naming the field ([validated by: validateMessage accepts list_conversations and rejects out-of-range limit and non-cursor before](../../src/transport/ws/conversationList.acceptance.test.ts#L77)).
 
